{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1794446543107703445,"compiled_state":{"alias":"juiced-anarthrous-bird","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"b750b19f61f0cceb6d6fa4a19c3ebb6e31ca0d1cf21ecf406955451faa31e5dd","event_uuid":"ac27da24-91ec-4439-8d57-23846e8f7451","position":{"commit_sha":"693480bc6cc4f65374d16e1dcd82f8d853bae1bf","position":"1794446477421621409-ac27da24-91ec-4439-8d57-23846e8f7451"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"5867b86a73e1cfcdb160624660f1ceff4561f606bf299a52af58373fcc239258","event_uuid":"bb251559-53e8-4402-92ab-bee682b7aaf2","position":{"commit_sha":"e558051850fabf63780ab87a83091b40124fa01d","position":"1794446538822993797-bb251559-53e8-4402-92ab-bee682b7aaf2"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"ac445ba99ee7d12f604b19d52bc809a5e9a65a53b83f5187ff4fc6e3dfdbbb93","event_uuid":"ca36c1ae-0ca1-4b05-bd21-b753da85dc07","position":{"commit_sha":"c6f7e18e4ece8360214c90feffb4e542662f5fbf","position":"1794446543107703444-ca36c1ae-0ca1-4b05-bd21-b753da85dc07"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794446477421621409,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"bb251559-53e8-4402-92ab-bee682b7aaf2","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"6b02-067c-9dbb-47e7"},{"link_uuid":"ca36c1ae-0ca1-4b05-bd21-b753da85dc07","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"8806-198c-e2d6-46ce"}],"description":"## Observed (2026-11-11 PST, code reading plus production state)\n\n- `transition_ticket(closed)` over MCP pins completion verification to `resolve_ref(\"HEAD\", repo_root)` (`src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py:146`). The server's repo root is `REBAR_ROOT=/var/gerrit/site/mcp-code`.\n- That workspace is refreshed (fetch plus fast-forward) only by `infra/scripts/mcp-entrypoint.sh` at container start.\n- Autodeploy restarts the MCP container only when `MCP_PATHS` change (`infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh` mcp_delta; `src/rebar`, the Dockerfile, the entrypoint, the compose file, `uv.lock`, `pyproject.toml`). A commit touching only docs, tests, `infra/terraform` or other paths advances main without refreshing the workspace.\n- By contrast, the async starters (`review_plan_start`, `verify_completion_start`) resolve `origin/main` through `gate_source` and snapshot it.\n\n## Expected impact (not yet reproduced)\n\nAfter a non-MCP-path commit lands, an MCP close verifies and signs against an older tree. For a ticket whose only commit is non-MCP-path (for example docs-only), the close precheck should fail \"cannot confirm the work landed\", although the commit is on main.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Reproduced with a test: the close path's verified tree after main advances on a non-MCP path.\n- [ ] Close verification over MCP resolves current main (or the workspace refreshes on each main advance), pinned by a test.\n\nDiscovered while fixing reddish-drinkable-canvasback.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","9794-4336-5ed6-4561"],["relates_to","8806-198c-e2d6-46ce"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"9794-4336-5ed6-4561","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"0bc1-00c3-3c83-4792","ticket_type":"bug","title":"MCP close-gate verifies against a code workspace refreshed only at container start, so it lags main between MCP deploys","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ac27da24-91ec-4439-8d57-23846e8f7451","bb251559-53e8-4402-92ab-bee682b7aaf2","ca36c1ae-0ca1-4b05-bd21-b753da85dc07"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794446543107703445,"uuid":"cd37e412-8c8d-4e94-a6c0-e416f34b422c"}